    {
      "text": "玩家扮演中世纪理发外科医师，牌组主题融合塔罗秘术、肉体疗法与民间迷信。",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Take up the mantle of a medieval barber surgeon in BLOODLETTER, a deckbuilder inspired by the arcane art of tarot, ancient remedies of the flesh, and the surrounding superstitions.",
