      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "四个恐怖实体分别拥有独立胜利条件和设计，每个实体可在三档难度中净化。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "4 Dreadful entities, each a foul spirit with its own wicked win condition and design Each entity to be cleansed on three different difficulties",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3493400/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "十种以上 Transmuter 会根据当前规则改变卡牌可用方式，使同一牌组在不同局面重新解释。",
